    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check Out This</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/9f07a6b44d38966cdd8720ee81a169e4.poster.avif?t=1755403460\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/9f07a6b44d38966cdd8720ee81a169e4.webm?t=1755403460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/9f07a6b44d38966cdd8720ee81a169e4.mp4?t=1755403460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Whosoever is acknowledged by the elves will receive the power to change the world.&quot; These are the words of a forgotten legend\u2026 <br><br>Light Elf, forebringer of life, and Dark Elf, embodiment of corruption. Two powers struggled, rose, and fell. They finally found a balance and formed the world of today, known as the Continent of Elwes.<br><br>In the 34th year of the continent of Elwes, the Kraft Mercenary Corps of the Crey Territory in the Landar Kingdom coincidentally met the heir of the Lord, Freydis, inadvertently unveiling a conspiracy for lordship succession.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/b8f83f332089cd573d30e0e4bfca57e4.poster.avif?t=1755403460\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/b8f83f332089cd573d30e0e4bfca57e4.webm?t=1755403460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/b8f83f332089cd573d30e0e4bfca57e4.mp4?t=1755403460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/8dde095e158be395f2f67537fb1c2a6d.poster.avif?t=1755403460\" width=586 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/8dde095e158be395f2f67537fb1c2a6d.webm?t=1755403460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/8dde095e158be395f2f67537fb1c2a6d.mp4?t=1755403460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/92700ac7ea2c3b9ffbee359ac545fa3c.poster.avif?t=1755403460\" width=586 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/92700ac7ea2c3b9ffbee359ac545fa3c.webm?t=1755403460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/92700ac7ea2c3b9ffbee359ac545fa3c.mp4?t=1755403460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Deep strategy game, every move will affect the game situation<br></li><li>Large troop battles, testing your troop leading skills<br></li><li>Rich story, the game has multiple endings<br></li><li>2D turn-based tactical game</li></ul><br><br><strong>Loya Kaft</strong><br>Leader of the Kaft Mercenary Group, dissatisfied with the current state of the national system.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/5874fcdf0aa53aee46e8ccf7d98ebb0c.avif?t=1755403460\" width=700 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>Guren</strong><br>A rare member of the beastman race, possesses strong individual combat skills, and aspires to earn money to establish a Beastman autonomous region.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/850ac48176884ae86b7434d3c6aa8b34.avif?t=1755403460\" width=700 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>Serin</strong><br>Loya's adopted sister, possesses deep magical talents. She is very dependent on Loya.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/b0fae4ba5b75a129f84d92ceebbe7ae1.avif?t=1755403460\" width=700 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>Fei</strong><br>Has been part of many mercenary groups, and has a wealth of combat experience.<br>She is currently the strategist of the Kaft Mercenary Group.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854070/extras/3e36d751dc62c43707fb289fa817eb36.avif?t=1755403460\" width=700 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactics First</h2>The game includes troop countering and terrain changes, where utilizing the advantages of your troops and utilizing each and every soldier wisely can lead to ultimate victory.",
